   <description>
      <short>
         <en><![CDATA[Mail Analyzer GLPI Plugin — automatically combines CC/reply emails into one Ticket]]></en>
      </short>
      <long>
         <en><![CDATA[This solves the problem of duplicated Tickets when an email is sent to GLPI and CC to others, and when those CC recipients use 'Reply to All', GLPI by default will create a new ticket.
         In case of ping-pong emails it will add the replies as followups to the Ticket initially created by the first email.
         Compatible with GLPI 11.0+.]]></en>
      </long>
   </description>
